{"id":609,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"鎌倉学と国際環境学で育む実現力","feature_description":"鎌倉女学院は、鎌倉の地域性を生かした教科の学びと、鎌倉学・国際環境学を二つの軸に置き、自ら未来を思い描いて行動する実現力を育てます。六年間を通じて、課題を見つけ、調べ、対話し、考え、表現・発表する探究を繰り返します。基礎学力、論理的思考、幅広い教養、感性、倫理性、コミュニケーションを継続的に伸ばし、社会に役立つ自立した女性を目指します。","clubs":[{"id":11542,"name":"体操部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kamajo.ac.jp/clubactivities/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11543,"name":"バトン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kamajo.ac.jp/clubactivities/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11544,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kamajo.ac.jp/clubactivities/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11545,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kamajo.ac.jp/clubactivities/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11546,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kamajo.ac.jp/clubactivities/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11547,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kamajo.ac.jp/clubactivities/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11548,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kamajo.ac.jp/clubactivities/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11549,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kamajo.ac.jp/clubactivities/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11550,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kamajo.ac.jp/clubactivities/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11551,"name":"文芸部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kamajo.ac.jp/clubactivities/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11552,"name":"歴史研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kamajo.ac.jp/clubactivities/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11553,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kamajo.ac.jp/clubactivities/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11554,"name":"アニメまんが部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kamajo.ac.jp/clubactivities/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11555,"name":"パソコン部","c